### Get ESRI Vector Tile Metadata
GET https://localhost:8443/arcgis/rest/services/services/VectorTileServer/
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: gfwpro.globalforestwatch.org={{gfwpro_token}}


### Get ESRI Vector Tile Root
GET https://localhost:8443/arcgis/rest/services/services/VectorTileServer/resources/styles/root.json
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: gfwpro.globalforestwatch.org={{gfwpro_token}}


### Get ESRI Vector Tile List MBTile
GET https://localhost:8443/arcgis/rest/services/202209130343_64_1385_906c86b5_751b_46be_9bb1_8c6dcac55b77/VectorTileServer/10/824/509.pbf
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: gfwpro.globalforestwatch.org={{gfwpro_token}}


